    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@$\\mathbb{K}$,Type),Type.annotation(@V,Type),LA.Field($\\mathbb{K}$),LA.VectorSpace(V,$\\mathbb{K}$),Type.annotation(@W,$\\mathrm{Submodule}\\ \\mathbb{K}\\ V$),Type.annotation(@hIP,InnerProductSpace($\\mathbb{K}$,V))),def(Submodule.orthogonal(W),,$W^{\\perp} = \\{ x \\in V \\mid \\forall u \\in W,\\ \\langle u,x\\rangle = 0 \\}$))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "zh-CN",
        "values": {
          "zh-CN": "$W^\\perp=\\{x\\in V\\mid\\langle u,x\\rangle=0\\ \\forall u\\in W\\}$ 是 $W$ 的正交补，本身是子空间。Lean 中 `Submodule.orthogonal W`（记法 $Wᗮ$）只接受一个显式参数：子空间 $W$。",
          "en": "$W^\\perp=\\{x\\in V\\mid\\langle u,x\\rangle=0\\ \\forall u\\in W\\}$ is the orthogonal complement of $W$, itself a subspace. In Lean `Submodule.orthogonal W` (notation $Wᗮ$) takes one explicit argument, the subspace $W$."
